---
import { Mail, MessageCircle, Phone } from "@lucide/astro";
import { blogIndex } from "@/lib/site-data";
---

<footer class="bg-[#1d1d1f] text-white">
  <div class="container-wide pt-20 pb-10 sm:pt-24">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr_1fr] md:gap-0">
      <div>
        <a href="/" class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">
          AI <span class="gradient-text">Studio</span> TH
        </a>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm text-gray-400">
          AI rig บนโต๊ะสำหรับ developer, researcher และทีมเทคนิคเล็กที่ต้องการรัน
          model ในเครื่อง.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-6 md:border-t-0 md:border-l md:pt-0 md:pl-10">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">สำรวจ</h2>
        <div class="mt-2 grid justify-items-start text-sm text-gray-400">
          <a href="/blog" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center hover:text-white">{blogIndex.navLabel}</a>
          <a href="/builds" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center hover:text-white">Builds</a>
          <a href="/models" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center hover:text-white">Models</a>
          <a href="/benchmarks" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center hover:text-white">Benchmarks</a>
          <a href="/about" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center hover:text-white">About</a>
          <a href="/ecosystem" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center hover:text-white">Ecosystem</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center hover:text-white">Contact</a>
          <a href="/privacy" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center hover:text-white">นโยบายความเป็นส่วนตัว</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-6 md:border-t-0 md:border-l md:pt-0 md:pl-10">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">ติดต่อ</h2>
        <div class="mt-2 grid justify-items-start text-sm text-gray-400">
          <a data-cta="email" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 hover:text-white">
            <Mail size={15} />
          </a>
          <a data-cta="tel" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 hover:text-white">
            <Phone size={15} />
          </a>
          <a data-cta="line" class="link-line flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 hover:text-white">
            <MessageCircle size={15} />LINE Official
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-16 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-[13px] text-gray-400">
      © {new Date().getFullYear()} AI Studio TH
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
